###  http://www.semanticweb.org/diversify-ccam/TelecommunicationInfrastructure
:TelecommunicationInfrastructure rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 rdfs:subClassOf :DigitalInfrastructure ;
                                 rdfs:label "Telecommunication Infrastructure"@en ;
