                 rdfs:label "Transport System"@en ;
                 skos:definition "An organized network of infrastructure, vehicles, technologies, and services that enables the movement of people and goods within and across regions, supporting economic activity, social inclusion, and environmental sustainability."@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/diversify-ccam/Trust
:Trust rdf:type owl:Class ;
